From: XProtocol Bot
Subject: [PATCH] win32u: Find the present fence info before the host present.

win32u_vkQueuePresentKHR looked for VkSwapchainPresentFenceInfoKHR by walking the
present chain after the host vkQueuePresentKHR returned. With a present ID in the
chain (VkPresentIdKHR or VkPresentId2KHR, used by vkd3d-proton when the
VK_NV_low_latency2 path is active), the chain came back from the host call with
the present-ID structure's pNext pointing into a stack frame below Wine that had
already returned (seen on RADV with the low-latency layer, whose code does not
write the chain); the walk then followed that dangling link and faulted on the
first present (Where Winds Meet, layer in VK_NV_low_latency2 mode). Look the
structure up before the host call, so the chain is never read after the driver
and layers have had it.
---
--- a/dlls/win32u/vulkan.c
+++ b/dlls/win32u/vulkan.c
@@ -6325,6 +6325,17 @@
         present_info->pWaitSemaphores = &blit_sema;
     }
 
+    /* Managed swapchains have no host present to signal these fences. Look the fence info up
+     * before the host present: a driver or layer may splice its own stack structure into the
+     * chain during the call and leave a dangling link behind (seen on RADV
+     * with a present ID), so the chain must not be walked after it. */
+    for (const VkBaseInStructure *header = present_info->pNext; header; header = header->pNext)
+        if (header->sType == VK_STRUCTURE_TYPE_SWAPCHAIN_PRESENT_FENCE_INFO_KHR)
+        {
+            present_fence_info = (const VkSwapchainPresentFenceInfoKHR *)header;
+            break;
+        }
+
     res = VK_SUCCESS;
     /* Host present consumes waits for host swapchains. */
     if (host_count)
@@ -6370,14 +6381,6 @@
         }
     }
 
-    /* Managed swapchains have no host present to signal these fences. */
-    for (const VkBaseInStructure *header = present_info->pNext; header; header = header->pNext)
-        if (header->sType == VK_STRUCTURE_TYPE_SWAPCHAIN_PRESENT_FENCE_INFO_KHR)
-        {
-            present_fence_info = (const VkSwapchainPresentFenceInfoKHR *)header;
-            break;
-        }
-
     /* All-managed presents consume the live wait array once here. */
     if (!host_count && present_info->waitSemaphoreCount)
     {
